sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title YuPay — Octo card payment (hosted page, one-stage)

    participant U as User (miniapp)
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant PAY as payments.service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant OCTO_AD as OctoGateway
    participant OCTO as Octo (secure.octo.uz)
    participant FUL as fulfillment.service

    Note over U,OCTO: pending_payment order, currency ∈ {UZS, USD, RUB}

    U->>API: POST /payments/intents {order_id, provider: octo}
    API->>PAY: create_intent(order_id, "octo")
    PAY->>DB: SELECT order FOR UPDATE (status == pending_payment)
    PAY->>OCTO_AD: create_intent(db, order, return_url)
    OCTO_AD->>OCTO: POST /prepare_payment {shop_id, secret, shop_transaction_id, total_sum, currency, auto_capture:true, notify_url, return_url, test}
    OCTO-->>OCTO_AD: 200 {error:0, data:{octo_payment_UUID, octo_pay_url, status:"created"}}
    OCTO_AD-->>PAY: PaymentIntent(external_id=UUID, intent_url=pay_url, status=pending)
    PAY->>DB: INSERT payments(provider=octo, status=pending, external_id=UUID)
    PAY-->>U: 201 {intent_url}
    U->>OCTO: open octo_pay_url, pay with card

    Note over OCTO,API: Octo signs the callback body: SHA1(unique_key + UUID + status)

    OCTO->>API: POST /webhooks/payments/octo {octo_payment_UUID, status:"succeeded", signature, maskedPan, rrn}
    API->>PAY: handle_webhook("octo", headers, body)
    PAY->>OCTO_AD: verify_webhook(body)
    OCTO_AD-->>PAY: WebhookEvent(external_event_id="UUID:succeeded", outcome=succeeded)
    PAY->>DB: INSERT payment_webhooks (dedup on provider+external_event_id)
    PAY->>DB: payment.status=succeeded; order.status=paid (_mark_payment_succeeded)
    PAY->>FUL: start_for_order(order_id)
    PAY-->>OCTO: 200 {status: processed}

    Note over OCTO,PAY: a replay of the same (UUID:status) → 200 {duplicate}; a bad signature → 422
